{"products":[{"id":10601095528750,"title":"Quick Light™ Kit","handle":"quick-light-kit","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOur Quick Light™ charcoal grate and starter tool give you a better way to start the fire. Whether you're a seasoned grill master or new to cooking on the Egg, the Quick Light™ Kit gives you faster, more reliable ignition, less ash buildup, cleaner hands, and more even-burning coals. Light your charcoal from below, every time you start your Egg.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eReady to Cook Sooner:\u003c\/strong\u003e Efficient ignition from the bottom of the Egg helps you reach cooking temperature more quickly.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCleaner hands: \u003c\/strong\u003eNo need to bury a fire starter or rearrange charcoal by hand. Simply dump charcoal into your Egg’s firebox and light it from below.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMore Even Heat: \u003c\/strong\u003eThe honeycomb grate improves airflow to help minimize hot spots and maintain consistent cooking temperatures. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReduces Ash Buildup: \u003c\/strong\u003eLarger grate openings allow ash to fall through for easier cleanup.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt to Last: \u003c\/strong\u003eHeavy-duty 430 stainless steel can stand up to decades of high-heat cooking.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCompatible with M, L, XL and 2XL Eggs. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003ci\u003e(Quick Light Tool does not work with cast iron charcoal grate.)\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-07-15T14:38:05-04:00","cr