2798 BCX0\"\u003e® patches and Kevlar® stitching, these\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW260422798 BCX0\"\u003epremium\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW260422798 BCX0\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003ecowhide gloves let you grip, lift,\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW260422798 BCX0\"\u003eor\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW260422798 BCX0\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003ereposition a hot grate, deflector, or pizza wedge with a steady hand\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW260422798 BCX0\"\u003e.\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW260422798 BCX0\"\u003eSo,\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW260422798 BCX0\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eyou can focus on the cook, not the\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW260422798 BCX0\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eheat\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW260422798 BCX0\"\u003e. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-ccp-props=\"{}\" class=\"EOP SCXW260422798 BCX0\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ewa-rteLine\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ewa-rteLine\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProven Performance:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e \u003cspan data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW87592602 BCX0\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW87592602 BCX0\"\u003eExtensively tested in extreme heat conditions,\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun CommentStart SCXW87592602 BCX0\"\u003eHell Hands allow you to manage and move cookware up to 900°F (482°C).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"EOP SCXW87592602 BCX0\" data-ccp-props='{\"134245418\":true,\