":"2026-04-13T11:55:44-04:00","product_id":10498281341230,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/DSC03584copy-2_14b5a081-8d41-4954-992d-9fe190aecc14.jpg?v=1776095744","width":1024,"height":1536},{"id":53649748885806,"created_at":"2026-04-13T11:54:52-04:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-04-13T11:55:44-04:00","product_id":10498281341230,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/DSC01500_945351aa-1529-408a-ad12-5eec14e2debe.jpg?v=1776095744","width":1024,"height":683},{"id":53649423368494,"created_at":"2026-04-13T10:07:18-04:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-04-13T11:55:44-04:00","product_id":10498281341230,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/DSC01631.jpg?v=1776095744","width":1024,"height":683},{"id":53649423335726,"created_at":"2026-04-13T10:07:18-04:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-04-13T11:55:44-04:00","product_id":10498281341230,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/DSC01533.jpg?v=1776095744","width":1024,"height":683}],"options":[{"name":"Size","position":1,"values":["M","L","XL"]}]},{"id":9654623371566,"title":"EGGniter® Electric Charcoal Lighter with Fan (1500 Watt\/120v)","handle":"eggniter-electric-charcoal-lighter-with-fan-1500-watt-120v","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe Electric EGGniter is a tool designed for easy ignition of lump charcoal or hardwood. This innovative tool harnesses super-heated air to light lump charcoal or hardwood in minutes, eliminating the need for matches or lighter fluid. Its robust aluminum heat shield and three-setting power system (Off\/Fan\/Hot) ensure precise control and safety. The automatic OFF switch and 6-foot (1.8 m) power cord add convenience to your outdoor cooking ritual.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eDimensions: [Insert specific dimensions]\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eWeight: [Insert weight in lbs (kg)]\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003ePower: 120V\/1500W\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eCord length: 6 ft (1.8 m)\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eWarranty: 1 year\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe Electric EGGniter seamlessly integrates with your egg system, streamlining your grilling preparation. Its patented technology represents the future of charcoal ignition, trusted by outdoor cooking enthusiasts worldwide. Join the community of discerning grillers who value efficiency and precision in their culinary pursuits.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-11-18T09:58:24-05:00","created_at":"2024-11-18T09:58:24-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00","vendor":"Big Green Egg","product_type":"Lump Charcoals","tags":["BS","GS","Small-From DC"],"variants":[{"id":49590060745006,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"117540","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"99.99","grams":1089,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9654623371566,"created_at":"2024-11-18T09:58:24-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":49688693244206,"created_at":"2025-03-26T11:54:40-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-03-26T11:54:42-04:00","product_id":9654623371566,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/eggnite-cord-_1.png?v=1743004482","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9654861562158,"title":"100% Natural Lump Charcoal Oak \u0026 Hickory","handle":"100-natural-lump-charcoal-oak-hickory","body_html":"\u003cdiv id=\"content\"\u003eBig Green Egg is committed to eco-friendly and natural products — what else would you expect from a company whose middle name is “Green”?! Big Green Egg painstakingly sources our natural charcoal to ensure that it contains no fillers, nitrates, chemicals, anthracite coal, limestone, treated wood or petroleum products. Unlike some of the other charcoals and briquettes on the market today, pure and natural Big Green Egg charcoal is premium carbonized wood with NO additives whatsoever.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e \u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"additional_details\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy natural charcoal? What’s the difference?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e \u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eBig Green Egg charcoal contains only 100% natural American oak and hickory “ultra premium” hardwood … you will see — and taste — the difference immediately. What else would you want to cook with? Big Green Egg 100% Natural Lump Charcoal is easy to light and is usually ready to cook in about 10 minutes. Plus, it burns hotter and more efficiently, with more BTUs, than charcoal briquettes. Our premium lump charcoal also produces less ash so there is minimal waste and clean up … delivering more value and performance in every bag. But, most importantly, food tastes better, without harsh chemicals or odors that can be released when cooking with briquettes or other similar products. In fact, we recommend against ever using briquettes, lighter fluids or any quick-light charcoal product in a Big Green Egg. Natural Lump Charcoal - 390011 20 lb \/ 9 kg bag\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufactured in the USA from premium, select hardwoods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBig Green Egg Natural Lump Charcoal meets EPA environmental guidelines and is CE Certified in the European Union (EU).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2024-11-18T16:43:05-05:00","created_at":"2024-11-18T16:43:05-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00","vendor":"Big Green Egg","product_type":"Lump Charcoals","tags":["GS","Small-From DC"],"variants":[{"id":49590876471598,"title":"Oak \u0026 Hickory","option1":"Oak \u0026 Hickory","option2":"Default Title","option3":null,"sku":"127884","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"29.99","grams":8391,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9654861562158,"created_at":"2024-11-18T16:43:05-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":55195329200430,"created_at":"2026-09-29T21:09:48-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-29T21:10:38-04:00","product_id":9654861562158,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/DSC06693copy_3.jpg?v=1790730638","width":1024,"height":1024}],"options":[{"name":"Wood Type","position":1,"values":["Oak \u0026 Hickory","Canadian Maple","Hardwood"]}]},{"id":9658321731886,"title":"Natural Lump Charcoal Canadian Maple","handle":"natural-lump-charcoal-canadian-maple","body_html":"\u003cdiv id=\"content\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"content\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: helvetica; font-size: medium;\"\u003eBig Green Egg natural lump charcoal is an ultra-premium, natural product made only from select hardwoods. Unlike some other popular charcoals, pellets, or briquettes, this 100% natural product contains no fillers, nitrates, chemicals, coal, limestone, treated wood, or petroleum products of any kind. Demand the best for you Big Green Egg – and for The Ultimate Cooking Experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: helvetica; font-size: medium;\"\u003e**Not available in all markets**\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"additional_details\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: helvetica; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnjoy the Mild Flavor of Canadian Maple\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: helvetica; font-size: medium;\"\u003eThe flavor profile of our Natural Canadian Maple charcoal is the mildest of all Big Green Egg charcoal varieties. It is ideal for seafood, vegetables, pork, poultry, or any time you want the natural flavor of your food to shine through.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: helvetica; font-size: medium;\"\u003eSourced only from sustainable hardwood forests in Canada, this premium maple charcoal is easy to light and clean burning, imparting a subtle, sweet flavor to your food.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-01-14T14:24:26-05:00","created_at":"2024-11-20T23:24:04-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00","vendor":"Big Green Egg","product_type":"Lump Charcoals","tags":["GS","Small-From DC"],"variants":[{"id":49600600342830,"title":"Canadian Maple","option1":"Canadian Maple","option2":"Default Title","option3":null,"sku":"126993","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"34.99","grams":8391,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9658321731886,"created_at":"2024-11-20T23:24:05-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":55195334115630,"created_at":"2026-09-29T21:12:00-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-29T21:12:01-04:00","product_id":9658321731886,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/126993-3copy.jpg?v=1790730721","width":1024,"height":1024}],"options":[{"name":"Wood Type","position":1,"values":["Oak \u0026 Hickory","Canadian Maple","Hardwood"]}]},{"id":9658314883374,"title":"Natural Lump Hardwood Charcoal","handle":"natural-lump-hardwood-charcoal","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExperience authentic Brazilian Steakhouse Flavor!\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you are grilling churrasco in the gaucho tradition, or cooking a more delicate cut of fish or pork, you’ll enjoy the mild, oaky flavor of our restaurant quality Brazilian Hardwood Lump Charcoal. This subtle flavor profile pairs well with smoking chips and chunks for a variety of flavor profiles.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLights Quickly, Burns Hotter and Longer\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBecause it lights quickly and burns hotter and longer than most other woods, eucalyptus wood is the preferred fuel for the most famous Brazilian steakhouses. Big Green Egg Lump Charcoal reaches cooking temperature in just minutes, and is more fuel efficient than charcoal briquettes or pellets.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIt’s only Natural\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur lump charcoal contains no fillers, nitrates, chemicals, or petroleum products. Our premium lump charcoal produces less ash than briquettes, so there is minimal waste and clean up … delivering more value and performance in every bag!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBig Green Egg Brazilian Hardwood Charcoal is produced using sustainable eucalyptus wood, and the process includes soil and water preservation efforts, with no deforestation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdds a mild, oaky flavor to foods, and works well with smoking chips and chunks for a variety of flavor profiles.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-01-14T16:05:54-05:00","created_at":"2024-11-20T23:21:33-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00","vendor":"Big Green Egg","product_type":"Lump Charcoals","tags":["Small-From DC"],"variants":[{"id":49600593232174,"title":"Hardwood","option1":"Hardwood","option2":"Default Title","option3":null,"sku":"127013","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"27.99","grams":8391,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9658314883374,"created_at":"2024-11-20T23:21:33-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":55195335295278,"created_at":"2026-09-29T21:13:04-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-29T21:13:06-04:00","product_id":9658314883374,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/127013-2copy.jpg?v=1790730786","width":1024,"height":1024}],"options":[{"name":"Wood Type","position":1,"values":["Oak \u0026 Hickory","Canadian Maple","Hardwood"]}]},{"id":9654623961390,"title":"Weather-Proof Charcoal Storage Bag","handle":"weather-proof-charcoal-storage-bag","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eKeep your charcoal dry and ready with our all-weather storage bag. This robust polyester guardian shields up to 20 lbs (9 kg) of charcoal from the elements, ensuring your fuel stays pristine. The roll-top closure seals out moisture, while an oversized, water-resistant pocket safeguards your essential grilling tools. Seamlessly integrating with your egg system, this bag stands ready for any outdoor cooking adventure.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cul\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eHeavy-gauge polyester construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eCapacity: 20 lbs (9 kg) of charcoal\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eRoll-top closure for maximum weather protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n  \u003cli\u003eAccessory pocket with water-resistant zipper\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2024-11-18T09:58:34-05:00","created_at":"2024-11-18T09:58:34-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00","vendor":"Big Green Egg","product_type":"Lump Charcoals","tags":["GS","Small-From DC"],"variants":[{"id":49590062907694,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"128201","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"69.99","grams":907,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9654623961390,"created_at":"2024-11-18T09:58:34-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":49688690557230,"created_at":"2025-03-26T11:54:23-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-03-26T11:54:25-04:00","product_id":9654623961390,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/charcoal-storage-_1.png?v=1743004465","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9654635626798,"title":"Ash Tool for S, MX or MN EGGs","handle":"ash-tool-for-s-mx-or-mn-eggs","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eAsh Tool actually has two functions: you can easily remove the ash in the Big Green Egg with it, but you can also use the tool to distribute the charcoal before lighting the Egg. This practical tool works very well with the Ash Removal Pan.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo optimally manage the temperature when using the Egg, it's important to have as little ash as possible in it. Fortunately, the Ash Tool likes to clean. With the metal fire rake, you can easily remove all ash to the edge, which benefits your dishes. The Ash Tool is available in three sizes and after use, you can easily hang it up.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-11-18T10:02:24-05:00","created_at":"2024-11-18T10:02:24-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00","vendor":"Big Green Egg","product_type":"Oven \u0026 Grill Cleaners","tags":["Small-From DC"],"variants":[{"id":49590114615598,"title":"S, MX, MN","option1":"S, MX, MN","option2":"Default Title","option3":null,"sku":"119513","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"19.99","grams":227,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9654635626798,"created_at":"2024-11-18T10:02:24-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":48836289954094,"created_at":"2025-01-02T14:39:01-05:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-01-14T15:43:11-05:00","product_id":9654635626798,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/Ash-tool-for-minimax.png?v=1736887391","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Fits Egg Size","position":1,"values":["2XL, XL","L, M","S, MX, MN"]}]},{"id":9654635430190,"title":"Ash Tool w\/Soft Grip Handle for 2XL or XL EGGs","handle":"ash-tool-w-soft-grip-handle-for-2xl-or-xl-eggs","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eAsh Tool actually has two functions: you can easily remove the ash in the Big Green Egg with it, but you can also use the tool to distribute the charcoal before lighting the EGG. This practical tool works very well with the Ash Removal Pan.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eTo optimally manage the temperature when using the EGG, it's important to have as little ash as possible in it. Fortunately, the Ash Tool likes to clean. With the metal fire rake, you can easily remove all ash to the edge, which benefits your dishes. The Ash Tool is available in three sizes and after use, you can easily hang it up.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-11-18T10:02:19-05:00","created_at":"2024-11-18T10:02:20-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00","vendor":"Big Green Egg","product_type":"Oven \u0026 Grill Cleaners","tags":["Small-From DC"],"variants":[{"id":49590113894702,"title":"2XL, XL","option1":"2XL, XL","option2":"Default Title","option3":null,"sku":"119490","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"39.99","grams":386,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9654635430190,"created_at":"2024-11-18T10:02:20-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":48326155731246,"created_at":"2024-11-18T10:02:20-05:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-01-14T15:43:13-05:00","product_id":9654635430190,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/ash-tool-800x500-1.png?v=1736887393","width":800,"height":500}],"options":[{"name":"Fits Egg Size","position":1,"values":["2XL, XL","L, M","S, MX, MN"]}]},{"id":9654635528494,"title":"Ash Tool w\/Soft Grip Handle for L or M EGGs","handle":"ash-tool-w-soft-grip-handle-for-l-or-m-eggs","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe Ash Tool serves two functions: it easily removes ash from the Big Green Egg, and it can also be used to distribute charcoal before lighting the EGG. This practical tool works very well with the Ash Removal Pan. The Ash Tool is available for Large and Medium sized Big Green Eggs.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-11-