"vendor":"Big Green Egg","product_type":"Oven \u0026 Grill Cleaners","tags":["GS","Small-From DC"],"variants":[{"id":49590113730862,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"106049","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"29.99","grams":458,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9654635331886,"created_at":"2024-11-18T10:02:18-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":48326154125614,"created_at":"2024-11-18T10:02:18-05:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-01-14T15:43:14-05:00","product_id":9654635331886,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/ash-removal-pan-800x500-1.png?v=1736887394","width":800,"height":500}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9654634643758,"title":"Grid Gripper for lifting stainless cooking grids and planks","handle":"grid-gripper-for-lifting-stainless-cooking-grids-and-planks","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThis stainless steel grid lifter is designed for easy handling of hot grilling surfaces. Its ergonomic design ensures a secure grip on hot cooking surfaces, allowing you to adjust or remove grids and planks with confidence. The extended 18-inch (45.7 cm) reach keeps your hands safely away from intense heat, while the durable construction withstands temperatures up to 700°F (371°C). Seamlessly integrating with your egg system, this essential tool empowers you to master temperature control and achieve culinary perfection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade from high-grade stainless steel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLength: 18 inches (45.7 cm)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeat resistant up to 700°F (371°C)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with all egg grill sizes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2024-11-18T10:02:03-05:00","created_at":"2024-11-18T10:02:05-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00","vendor":"Big Green Egg","product_type":"Outdoor Grilling Planks","tags":["GS","Small-From DC","YBlocklist"],"variants":[{"id":49590111404334,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"118370","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"24.99","grams":227,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":9654634643758,"created_at":"2024-11-18T10:02:05-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:42:44-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":49845394768174,"created_at":"2025-04-14T11:00:12-04:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-04-14T11:00:13-04:00","product_id":9654634643758,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0901\/1465\/4510\/files\/grid-gripper-800x500-1_1.png?v=1744642813","width":1280,"height":800}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10410146922798,"title":"Split Heat Deflector","handle":"split-heat-deflector","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"ewa-rteLine\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW186340064 BCX0\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW186340064 BCX0\"\u003eExperience more flexible cooking with the Big Green Egg Split Heat Deflector. Designed for true dual-zone cooking, it lets you grill over direct heat on one side while gently cooking with indirect heat on the other - so entrées and sides finish together. Made from Big Green Egg’s improved ceramic, it delivers more usable cooking space for consistently better results.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ewa-rteLine\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"ewa-rteLine\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW222096913 BCX0\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"Paragraph SCXW222096913 BCX0\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW222096913 BCX0\"\u003e\u003cspan clas